---
layout: base.njk
title: "Insights — Web Design for Small Businesses"
description: "Practical web design, conversion, SEO, and platform guidance for small businesses in the US, UK, Canada, Australia, and beyond."
permalink: /insights/
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Insights for small business websites that actually work</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    No fluff. Honest advice on what works, what costs what, and what to
    fix — written specifically for small businesses in the US, UK, Canada,
    Australia, and beyond.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="pillar-grid">
  <h2>Browse by topic</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    {% for pillar in collections.pillars %}
      <a class="pillar-card" href="{{ pillar.url }}">
        <p class="cluster-name">{{ pillar.data.cluster | replace("-", " ") | title }}</p>
        <h3>{{ pillar.data.title }}</h3>
        {% if pillar.data.angle %}
          <p class="snippet">{{ pillar.data.angle | truncate(140) }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="latest">
  <h2>Latest insights</h2>
  <ul>
    {% set latest = collections.articles | reverse %}
    {% for item in latest %}
      {% if loop.index <= 10 %}
        <li>
          <a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a>
          <span class="meta">{{ item.data.cluster | replace("-", " ") | title }} · {{ item.date | readableDate }}</span>
        </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
